*Vanity Fair* excerpts Bill Carter's upcoming tell-all book about the nasty battle earlier this year between Jay Leno and Conan O'Brien, which put Leno back in charge of *The Tonight Show* only six months after he finally handed it over to O'Brien, who in turn left NBC for good.
